            "subject": "[All Waves] Star Citizen Alpha 4.10.3 PTU Patch Notes 13145606",
            "body": "Alpha Patch 4.10.3 has been released and is now available to test on the PTU environment! Patch should now show: VERSION 4.10.3-PTU.13145606\n    Audience: All Waves\n    Server Info: PTU Channel - US Only\n    Long Term Persistence: Enabled\nTesting/Feedback Focus\n    Stability, Bugfixes, LTP between PTU releases\n    New Missions: Vanduul Incursion\n    New FPS Weapon: LBCO Skarnov Rifle\n    IAE (On accelerated schedule)\n\n\nBugfixes & Technical\nTonight's build focuses on further performance and polish for IAE and Vanduul Incursion.\nPotential Fix: Counter is stuck at 0% after eliminating all hostiles on board the \"Blinding Hope\" Battaglia mission\nPotential Fix: Accepting a mission card at Wikelo's causes random missions to be accepted\nPotential Fix: There's a chance that the hostile AI ship will not shoot back at the Player during Bounty Hunter / Mercenary missions",
